#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:288
msgid ""
"When you quit the game, your PC goes back to Monet. If a launcher asks you to sign in, do it once: it remembers you."
msgstr "退出游戏后，你的电脑会回到 Monet。如果启动器要求登录，登录一次即可，它会记住你。"

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:290
msgid "Back to Monet now"
msgstr "立即返回 Monet"

